# Ask before other model APIs

Default: **do not** use Claude, Grok, GPT, Gemini, or similar APIs.

## Not allowed without explicit user permission
- Selecting those models via Task / subagent `model` overrides (`claude-*`, `cursor-grok-*`, `gpt-*`, etc.)
- Adding those providers’ SDKs or HTTP APIs into application code

## Allowed by default
- Subagents / Task **without** a foreign `model` override (same default agent as this session)
- Normal tooling (shell, read/edit, search, etc.)

## If you need another model
Ask the user first (which model and why). Only use it after they allow it for that request.
